error[NK2202]: `tail` is `sync`, but the cleanup of `Res`, `Res::cleanup`, can pause.
   --> tests/a_pausing_cleanup_of_an_unused_value_in_a_sync_function_is_nk2202.nika:28:5
    |
 28 |     Res { name: "c" }
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: A `sync` function promises never to pause or do I/O.
    = note: `Res` is cleaned up where it dies in `tail`, and `Res::cleanup` doesn't say `sync`.
    = help: Remove `sync` from `tail`, write `sync` after the signature of `Res::cleanup` if it never pauses, or create `Res` outside `tail` and pass it in.
